OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FLargely
OL,6,Fdry and settled over the next few days
OL,7,Fwith cloud at times but some long
OL,8,Fspells of sunshine on offer. Chillier
OL,9,Fnights than of late with frost in
OL,10,Fplaces.
